rimary side, so EC communication fails. The buffer U8 is also an unlisted part that drives the shared I2C_SDA bus from the isolated-side node, which can cause bus contention or latching.\", \"confidence\": 0.6}], \"summary\": \"The EC isolator U4's main-side SDA pin is not on the shared I2C_SDA bus; instead it feeds an unspecified 74LVC1G34 buffer (U8) whose output drives I2C_SDA. This departs from the symmetric U3/U4 wiring the spec describes and would break the EC channel's I2C path.\"}",
